  "question": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>/</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> (0.1 M) half cell is connected to a <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>/</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (1 bar)/Pt half cell and e.m.f. is found to be 0.7714 V. If <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.535</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> , find the pH of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> half cell.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The cell reaction is <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  <br/>Here <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> (n = number of electons involved ) <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>°</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.0591</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mn>0.7714</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.535</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.0591</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><mn>0.1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>On solving <math><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math>  <br/>So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
